{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るく快活な性格だが、少々気が強くナマイキ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかしその一方、甘えたい願望も強く持っていてその相反する性格を持っているため友人からはよく『猫みたい』と言われからかわれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"小さな頃は泣き虫だったせいか、うじうじするのが嫌い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どんな状況でもあきらめず自分を叱咤しながらも前に進もうと努力する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いとこの『理沙』を姉と慕い、理沙が勤めるマリポーサ社に入社することを目下の目標としている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15597","sourceWorkId":"18001","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"在普通的学园上学的学生。有些狂妄的傲娇系。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在仰慕的“姐姐”理沙面前是开朗可爱的娇状态，也有着喜欢任性的爱撒娇的一面。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"被关进研究所后也「不能在这种地方坐以待毙！」地鼓励自己寻找出口。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20018"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"89 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15597","sourceWorkId":"18001","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"81 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15597","sourceWorkId":"18001","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"56 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15597","sourceWorkId":"18001","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/05/05f5dc3c9d5e64d9ea19115c05784c1d1dd49b4c710bf650007c08fad4408d5d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d8/d861c1671ef60869117de4b058ca5556201fab583a28284a772c005ffc04de39.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"由倉奈於","creatorId":"vndb:s923","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s923","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s923","name":"由倉 奈於","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:61701:20018:6083:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c29412","characterName":"川岸 理沙","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"20019","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"61701"}],"egsC